# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data policy
#
# The committed result files under data/ ARE tracked -- they are this
# repository's own output and are the evidence the reports cite. What is
# excluded is (a) redistributed vendor price data and (b) large binaries.
#
# Raw Yahoo Finance price caches: no redistribution licence. Regenerate with
#   python scripts/fetch_pinned_universes.py
# See data/README.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/pinned_universes/
data/real_market_checkpoints/
covid.csv
*.jsonl

# Large binaries. The ten Axiom seed checkpoints are the exception: they are
# small (11.13 MiB total) and reproducibility-critical, so they are tracked.
*.pt
!checkpoints/axiom_multiseed/axiom_seed*.pt
*.pth
*.zip

# Everything under checkpoints/ except the ten Axiom seeds. The 120 v8.2
# checkpoints and the two archive zips belong in a release asset, not in git.
checkpoints/*
!checkpoints/axiom_multiseed/
checkpoints/axiom_multiseed/*
!checkpoints/axiom_multiseed/axiom_seed*.pt

# Run artefacts written next to the code
all_outputs.zip
per_seed_results.csv
per_universe_summary.json
